=== query ipa1 (primary) ===
0 100 88 ipa1.ipa.pilot.internal.
0 100 88 ipa2.ipa.pilot.internal.
=== query ipa2 (replica, just reconciled via Day-2 DNS install) ===
0 100 88 ipa2.ipa.pilot.internal.
0 100 88 ipa1.ipa.pilot.internal.

Command: dig @<server-ip> _kerberos._udp.ipa.pilot.internal SRV +short, run from ipa-ha-client
against both 192.168.122.8 (ipa1) and 192.168.122.7 (ipa2). Both authorities return the same
SRV RRset (both KDCs), confirming Phase 2's exit gate ("integrated DNS HA topology 兩台均可
authoritative answer") after the Day-2 reconciliation installed DNS on ipa2 (which had never had
it during this test's earlier freeipa_setup_dns=false step).
